          "doc": "Where a transition sends the individuals it moves.\n\n    {@camdl[\n      infection : S --> I @ beta * S * I / N\n      recovery  : I --> { R : 0.9, D : 0.1 } @ gamma * I\n    ]}\n\n    The two forms:\n    - [DstSum [I]] is a sum of compartments;\n    - [DstBranch] is a probabilistic branch.\n\n    Compare {!Ir.expr}.",
